          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The runner enlightens the data."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "intro": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Without the runner, there is telemetry. With the runner, the data acquires meaning."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "problem": {
    "label": "The problem",
    "heading": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do you really need all that data?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A consistent approach. \nData, data, data. We swallow data and information, thinking we know. But do we know how to use them? Or are we simply overwhelmed by them? The data that matters. A plan. But an adaptable one."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "isVisible": true
  },
  "restraint": {
    "label": "A deliberate restraint",
    "heading": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Not another dashboard asking to be obeyed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is not an attempt to reproduce every metric, build a universal coach, or turn running into a compliance exercise. It makes room for interpretation while keeping the objective in view."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "isVisible": true
  },
  "principles": {
    "label": "Principles",
    "heading": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A system should assist without taking the runner out of the picture."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
