          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The visual study below is not a product dashboard. It explains the idea: heart-rate intensity moves from pink towards red; a long pause lets the runner collapse, while a short one keeps them jogging in place."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
